{"code":0,"msg":"获取成功","time":"2026-09-17 18:02:24","data":{"id":"cafa43a8-e2b6-2ebc-381a-9d972e68c9bd","com_id":"5f828458-ecf5-d58f-515a-0477a35d537a","job_id":"bcaa78a8-4af2-0df5-9181-309308d26c43","school_id":"1917e634-eee1-1358-537d-7e36f6f41777","addtime":1789623699,"istop":2,"complaint":0,"resume_count":0,"work_name":"硬件工程师","schoolwarn":"请各位同学在求职时提高警惕，凡涉及收取各种费用；几乎不面试就给出录取通知，且到外地就职的招聘等情况，要仔细辨别，谨防上当受骗。","remarks":"<p =\"text-align: left; line-height: 25pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">岗位职责：<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; line-height: 25pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">1.承担部门硬件类研制项目(产品)的项目负责人<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; line-height: 25pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">2.负责硬件方案设计、元器件选型、硬件原理图PCB设计评审、BOM及生产文件输出、文档编写等工作;<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; line-height: 25pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">3.负责硬件单板\/产品的硬件调试，硬件测试; 处理项目中硬件方面的问题，并组织问题的分析、定位、攻关，对行业新技术、新趋势发展有一定研究，有较强的逻辑思维能力及学习能力;<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; line-height: 25pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">4.负责制定产品规格，按需求评估、挑选系统部件及关键部件供应商，并进行成本控制:<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; line-height: 25pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">5.配合或指导FPGA、软件工程师完成项目(产品)的调试测试:<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; line-height: 25pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">6.负责完成技术设计文件归档，确保技术资料完整；对归档的技术文件负责;<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; line-height: 25pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">7.配合生产部门规划撰写生产测试文档、保证研发产品顺利转产。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">8.完成领导安排的其它工作。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; line-height: 25pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">任职要求（年龄、经验等）：<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; line-height: 25pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">1.硕士及以上学历，航空航天<\/span><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">院校的<\/span><\/span><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">电子、通信、自动化、测控技术等相关专业，有经验者优先。具有扎实的电路基础知识，熟悉数字电路、模拟电路设计和分析<\/span>; <\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; line-height: 25pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">2.熟练使用Cadence软件工具进行原理图PCB设计 <\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; line-height: 25pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">3.熟练掌握常用CPU最小系统设计及原理(如ARM、POWERPC、MCU、FPGA等)，具有可靠性设计基本方法(如降额设计、EMC设计、热设计等)的产品应用经验; <\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; line-height: 25pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">4.熟悉或了解PCle、USB、HDMI、DP、LVDS、SATA、DDR3\/4、以太网(100M\/1000M\/10G)、SRIO、204B、UART、I2C、SPI、CAN、AD\/DA等常用计算机总线接口设计; <\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; line-height: 25pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">5.熟悉CPC1、CPCIE、CPCIS、VPX、ATX等架构; <\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; line-height: 25pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\">6.熟练使用万用表、示波器、电子负载、信号发生器、频谱分析仪等常用仪器仪表: <\/span><\/p>\n<p><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">7.有航空航天项目经验者优先 <\/span><\/span><\/p>","isdeliver":1,"status":1,"jobInfo":{"id":"bcaa78a8-4af2-0df5-9181-309308d26c43","jobtype":1,"work_name":"硬件工程师","dalei_id":"6954e3d1-a17f-4926-3d35-02b70a31af35","cate_id1":"e1fff988-9788-f06e-b6dc-a46a64346e65","cate_id2":"411374f9-8504-4e44-37d2-35780a5724a8","province_id":11,"city_id":1101,"district_id":0,"isday":0,"salary_floor":20000,"salay_ceil":0,"status":1,"create_id":"cb976bdc-6f59-9270-00cb-fe1fcd16ee49","addtime":1789623650,"person_count":"1人","com_id":"5f828458-ecf5-d58f-515a-0477a35d537a","com_id_name":"北京太宇星空探索科技有限公司","label":"","xueli_id":"0e6dfa9f-0f1f-0b48-102f-5a378e4cc136","laiyuan":2,"sharetype":0,"viewcount":43,"complaint":0,"work_days":"","practice_month":"","chance":3,"isedit":2,"resume_count":0,"expire_time":0,"address":"北清路81号中关村壹号A2座8层","start_time":0,"end_time":0,"teacher_business":"","refresh_time":0,"is_del":2,"is_expire":1,"exposure":0,"wm_id":null,"certificate":"","job_id":"bcaa78a8-4af2-0df5-9181-309308d26c43","remarks":"<p =\"text-align: left; line-height: 25pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">岗位职责：<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; line-height: 25pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 黑体;\">1.承担部门硬件类研制项目(产品)的项目负责人<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; line-height: 25pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; fon